  "system": {
    "identifier": "aburame-gentle-maggots",
    "description": "<p>You call upon some of the more helpful insects in your arsenal, and attempt to soothe the pain of your allies. One willing creature in your reach, regains 3d8+4 hit points.</p>\n<p>If you have your Swarm active when you cast this jutsu you can also make an Animal handling check vs a DC 20. On a success, you pick with bonus the target benefits from:</p>\n<p>The target loses a rank of one Physical condition it has.</p>\n<p>The target increases its speed by +10 and gains a +1 bonus to its next saving throw before the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the hit points regained by 1d8.</p>",
